# [SML](../wg/sml.html)

## Summary

The Structured Email (SML) Working Group met at IETF 117. The session covered proposals for handling large email attachments, origin-bound one-time passcodes (OTP) in email, structured action requests, structured vacation notices (`draft-ietf-sml-structured-vacation-notices`), structured quoted content (`draft-ietf-sml-structured-quoted-content`), and updates to the core Structured Email specification (`draft-ietf-sml-structured-email`). A working group poll was conducted regarding the adoption of the OTP-tokens-in-email draft.

## Key Discussion Points

